Subject: [PATCH 5/9] ui: desktop font and a color emoji fallback on Linux

Use the desktop's interface font for all text (Desktop Settings has a switch),
and name Noto Color Emoji as the fallback for the text styles that asked for the
Apple Color Emoji font, which the app does not ship on Linux. Without it the
engine's fallback picked monochrome symbol fonts: tofu boxes in names and
previews, flat white hearts.
